    { "f": { "type": "uri", "value": "https://opendata.eselpoint.gov.cz/esel-esb/eli/cz/sb/1963/99/2026-01-01/dokument/norma/cast_3/hlava_4/par_175a/odst_1" }	, "order": { "type": "typed-literal", "datatype": "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string", "value": "6BE3C95680" }	, "cit": { "type": "typed-literal", "datatype": "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string", "value": "\u00A7 175a odst. 1" }	, "c": { "type": "uri", "value": "https://opendata.eselpoint.gov.cz/esel-esb/pr\u00E1vn\u00ED-akt-fragment/922086261" }	, "type": { "type": "uri", "value": "https://opendata.eselpoint.gov.cz/esel-esb/cis-esb-typ-fragmentu/polo\u017Eka/Odstavec_Dc" }	, "text": { "type": "typed-literal", "datatype": "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string", "value": "<var>(1)</var> Uplatn\u00ED-li \u017Ealobce v \u017Ealob\u011B pr\u00E1vo na vyklizen\u00ED bytu nebo domu proti \u017Ealovan\u00E9mu, kter\u00FD byt nebo d\u016Fm u\u017E\u00EDv\u00E1 i po dni, kdy mu pr\u00E1vo u\u017E\u00EDv\u00E1n\u00ED zaniklo z d\u016Fvodu skon\u010Den\u00ED n\u00E1jmu, a vypl\u00FDv\u00E1-li pr\u00E1vo \u017Ealobce ze skute\u010Dnost\u00ED uveden\u00FDch v \u017Ealob\u011B a p\u0159ipojen\u00FDch p\u00EDsemn\u00FDch d\u016Fkaz\u016F, m\u016F\u017Ee soud vydat i bez v\u00FDslovn\u00E9 \u017E\u00E1dosti \u017Ealobce a bez sly\u0161en\u00ED \u017Ealovan\u00E9ho rozkaz k vyklizen\u00ED. V rozkazu k vyklizen\u00ED soud \u017Ealovan\u00E9mu ulo\u017E\u00ED, aby do 15 dn\u016F od doru\u010Den\u00ED rozkazu k vyklizen\u00ED byt nebo d\u016Fm vyklidil a zaplatil n\u00E1klady \u0159\u00EDzen\u00ED nebo aby v t\u00E9\u017Ee lh\u016Ft\u011B podal odpor u soudu, kter\u00FD rozkaz k vyklizen\u00ED vydal." }},
    { "f": { "type": "uri", "value": "https://opendata.eselpoint.gov.cz/esel-esb/eli/cz/sb/1963/99/2026-01-01/dokument/norma/cast_3/hlava_4/par_175a/odst_2" }	, "order": { "type": "typed-literal", "datatype": "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string", "value": "6BE3C95780" }	, "cit": { "type": "typed-literal", "datatype": "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string", "value": "\u00A7 175a odst. 2" }	, "c": { "type": "uri", "value": "https://opendata.eselpoint.gov.cz/esel-esb/pr\u00E1vn\u00ED-akt-fragment/922086263" }	, "type": { "type": "uri", "value": "https://opendata.eselpoint.gov.cz/esel-esb/cis-esb-typ-fragmentu/polo\u017Eka/Odstavec_Dc" }	, "text": { "type": "typed-literal", "datatype": "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string", "value": "<var>(2)</var> Rozkaz k vyklizen\u00ED nelze vydat," }},
